{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\n13日の金曜日でしたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\n沈黙の金曜日でしたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13金を流せば良かったわあ\n本当に後悔..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1曲目は自分で選んでるんだけど\n何も考えず自己中に\n自分が歌ってる曲を流しちゃいました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『欲望のリインカーネーション』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなんだもん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは\nバンドじゃないもん!の\n甘夏ゆずさんと天照大桃子さん\nでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/14/8697252/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく面白くて\nこういうかたとお友達になりたい！\nと思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/14/8697252/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブにもいつかお邪魔したい` ･ω･ ´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてくださったみなさん\n観覧来てくださったみなさん\nありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/14/8697252/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はじょしらく2公演目"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と\nもうひとつ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月のラジオで\n『口約束』の解禁です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これまた中田は\nまだ完成形を聴いてないので\nちゃんと聴かなきゃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/14/8697252/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"b